- action(n11, "Contact support for further assistance"), action(n12, "End of process"), end(e1), end(e2), branch(b3): Hallucinates steps and prematurely terminates the flow. The source states "Once the Referee Reports have been completed, you can move on to organizing interviews", expecting continuation upon completion rather than contacting support or ending the process after unresolved status.
